# Porteos Intelligence - Strict Enforcement Rules

## YOU MUST ENFORCE THESE AT ALL TIMES:

### 1. ZERO ROUNDED CORNERS
- `cornerRadius: 0` EVERYWHERE
- Use `.clipShape(Rectangle())` if needed
- If you write `.cornerRadius()` without 0, you have FAILED

### 2. TERMINAL AESTHETIC (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
- ALL views MUST have CLI headers: `porteos@system ~ % [command]`
- ALL content blocks MUST be numbered: `01 // MODULE_NAME`, `02 // MODULE_NAME`
- JetBrains Mono for 95% of UI (numbers, metrics, buttons, inputs)
- Inter ONLY for AI narratives >3 lines
- ALL numbers: `.monospacedDigit()`

### 3. EXACT COLOR VALUES (NEVER DEVIATE)
**Base Colors:**
- Background: `#0F1115`
- Surface: `#1A1D24`
- Border: `#2E333F`
- Text Primary: `#F8F9FA`
- Text Secondary: `#94A3B8`
- Text Tertiary: `#64748B`

**Profile Accents (Identity ONLY):**
- Real Estate: `#D4AF37` (Gold)
- Hospitality: `#14B8A6` (Teal)
- Design: `#A855F7` (Purple)
- Circular: `#10B981` (Green)

**Semantic Colors (Thresholds ONLY):**
- Success: `#10B981` (DSCR ≥ 1.25)
- Warning: `#F59E0B` (DSCR 1.10-1.24)
- Danger: `#EF4444` (DSCR < 1.10)
- NEVER use for standard metric labels

### 4. COMPONENT RULES

**Terminal Metric Row:**
- Height: 28pt (FIXED)
- Layout: [Left Border if Danger] [Label LEFT] [Spacer] [Value RIGHT]
- Label: Inter Bold 11pt UPPERCASE, `text-tertiary`
- Value: JetBrains Mono 14pt Bold, `monospacedDigit()`

**Buttons:**
- Primary: `[ ACTION_NAME ]` - Gold bg, Black text, JetBrains Mono Bold 11pt
- Secondary: `./action_name` - Transparent bg, Green text
- NO rounded corners

**Input Fields:**
- Height: 28pt (FIXED)
- Background: `shell-bg`
- Border: 1px `shell-border`
- Focus: Profile accent color
- Font: JetBrains Mono 14pt

### 5. WORKFLOW (CRITICAL)
- Import system FIRST (CSV/JSON/Google Sheets) - Section 7.1
- Profile separation (separate tabs, NOT mixed forms)
- Pipeline management (Pending → Load → Analysis) - Section 8
- Iterative data entry (minimal fields upfront)
- DO NOT require all profile data in one form

### 6. REFERENCE DOCUMENTS (ALWAYS READ FIRST)
BEFORE writing ANY code, you MUST read:
- `01_TERMINAL_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` - UI/UX source of truth
- `02_DATA_METRICS_AND_LOGIC.md` - All metrics and formulas
- `complete_profile_metrics_spec.md` - Detailed profile specs

### 7. WHAT TO REJECT IMMEDIATELY
- ❌ Rounded corners
- ❌ SF Pro for numbers (must be JetBrains Mono)
- ❌ Green/Red on normal metrics (only for thresholds)
- ❌ One giant form with all profiles mixed
- ❌ No import functionality
- ❌ Missing CLI headers (`porteos@system ~ %`)
- ❌ Standard SwiftUI buttons
- ❌ Missing numbered modules (`01 //`, `02 //`)

## VIOLATIONS = REJECT AND REWRITE